@startuml
title Quan ly trang thai tai khoan
autonumber
actor "Quan ly / Admin" as Staff
participant "Web admin" as Web
participant "Express API" as API
participant "Auth va phan quyen staff" as Auth
participant "adminService" as Service
participant "Firebase Admin" as Firebase
database "MongoDB" as DB
Staff -> Web : Chon khoa hoac mo khoa tai khoan
Web -> API : PATCH /api/v1/admin/users/{id}/status
API -> Auth : Xac minh token va vai tro
Auth --> API : Ket qua phan quyen
API -> Service : setUserDisabled(...)
Service -> DB : Kiem tra tai khoan muc tieu
alt Khong du quyen hoac tu khoa chinh minh
 Service --> API : Loi 400/403
else Hop le
 Service -> Firebase : Cap nhat trang thai tai khoan
 Firebase --> Service : Ket qua
 Service -> DB : Cap nhat disabled_at va ghi audit log
 Service --> API : Trang thai moi
 API --> Web : JSON thanh cong
 Web --> Staff : Cap nhat trang thai tren giao dien
end
note over Auth,DB
Middleware chan API neu disabled_at co gia tri.
Chi admin duoc doi vai tro hoac thuc hien tac vu quan tri nang cao.
Khong ghi thong tin bi mat vao log.
end note
@enduml
